nswer their questions and  to prove that you can still be loved  without it feeling like a charity but  you can't this is it for the rest of  your life you are this you are helpless  and hopeless for anything beyond a  vegetative state you can't even kill  yourself if you wanted to if you're  lucky maybe you all get to go home soon  and lay in your own bed only to stare at  a different ceiling every dream you ever  had for the future gone any activity you  wanted to enjoy this weekend impossible  everything you once knew any skill you  once had any success you once work for  essentially meaningless your life is  over with so many years left to live  now stop if they are closed open your  eyes step away from this reality let it  dissolve as you return to your own life  look at the world around you and recall  the conditions of your life recognize  the functioning body and mind that you  have acknowledged the words that you can  speak the people you can have healthy  relationships  the places you can go and the things you  can do all on your own free will  acknowledge all the little or boring  things that you might take for granted  every day your life may seem challenging  or dark at times and perhaps it is but  happiness is malleable it is influenced  by perception and perception is  influenced by how you choose to see and  think about things and this exercise  helps remind us how to think about  things it reminds us of what we have and  what we could lose at any moment if you  ever start to feel sorry for yourself  or lost in darkness try to remember the  feelings you just experienced try to  remember and you still have a lot to  appreciate and happiness only comes when  you appreciate it  thank you for watching if we found  enjoyment and value in this video please  give it a thumbs up share your thoughts  in the comments below and if you are not  already be sure to subscribe to our  channel we are constantly coming out  with new videos to help you experience  life